        s3n0 -->|l0,l1,l2| s3n1
        s3n1 -->|l0,l1,l3| s3n2
    end
    s0n2 -->|l0| s1n0
    s1n2 -->|l0| s2n0
    s2n2 -->|l0,l1,l2| s3n0
